{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-43947","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73418","text":"03 — Invocation Gateway"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43949","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73419","marks":["bold"],"text":"Purpose:"},{"id":"spn-73420","text":" How agent invocations flow through the Edge Function gateway, including the canonical request/response shapes, authentication, limit checks, session handling, streaming, and error normalization."}]}],"id":"blk-43948","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-43950","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73421","text":"Gateway Overview"}]},{"id":"blk-43951","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73422","text":"The invocation gateway is a Supabase Edge Function at "},{"id":"spn-73423","marks":["code"],"text":"/functions/v1/invoke/:agentId"},{"id":"spn-73424","text":". It authenticates the caller, checks plan limits, resolves the active deployment, routes to the runtime provider adapter, and returns a normalized response."}]},{"id":"blk-43952","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73425","text":"Request Shape ("},{"id":"spn-73426","marks":["code"],"text":"InvokeRequest"},{"id":"spn-73427","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-43953","kind":"code","language":"typescript","text":"interface InvokeRequest {\n  input: {\n    messages?: Array<{\n      role: \"system\" | \"user\" | \"assistant\" | \"tool\";\n      content: string;\n    }>;\n    prompt?: string;  // converted to messages if provided\n  };\n  sessionId?: string;  // opaque; provider-specific\n  options?: {\n    maxSteps?: number;\n    temperature?: number;\n    toolPolicy?: { allow?: string[]; deny?: string[] };\n  };\n  metadata?: {\n    traceId?: string;\n    client?: string;\n  };\n}"},{"id":"blk-43954","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73428","marks":["bold"],"text":"Rule:"},{"id":"spn-73429","text":" If "},{"id":"spn-73430","marks":["code"],"text":"prompt"},{"id":"spn-73431","text":" is provided instead of "},{"id":"spn-73432","marks":["code"],"text":"messages"},{"id":"spn-73433","text":", the gateway converts it to "},{"id":"spn-73434","marks":["code"],"text":"[{ role: \"user\", content: prompt }]"},{"id":"spn-73435","text":" before forwarding."}]},{"id":"blk-43955","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73436","text":"Response Shape ("},{"id":"spn-73437","marks":["code"],"text":"InvokeResponse"},{"id":"spn-73438","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-43956","kind":"code","language":"typescript","text":"interface InvokeResponse {\n  output: {\n    text: string;\n    messages?: Array<{ role: string; content: string }>;\n  };\n  sessionId?: string;\n  usage: {\n    tokens?: number;\n    computeMs?: number;\n    toolCalls?: number;\n  };\n  traceId: string;\n  error?: NormalizedError;\n}"},{"id":"blk-43957","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73439","text":"Gateway Pipeline"}]},{"id":"blk-43958","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"1. Parse request\n2. Authenticate (Supabase Auth JWT)\n3. Load agent record (RLS-filtered)\n4. Verify agent.status === \"active\"\n5. Resolve active deployment + runtime provider\n6. Check plan limits (billing_usage vs tier limits)\n7. Generate traceId (if not provided)\n8. Route to RPI adapter: invoke(input, sessionId, options)\n9. Normalize response\n10. Return to caller"},{"id":"blk-43959","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73440","text":"Authentication"}]},{"id":"blk-43960","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73441","text":"All invocations require a valid Supabase Auth JWT in the "},{"id":"spn-73442","marks":["code"],"text":"Authorization"},{"id":"spn-73443","text":" header:"}]},{"id":"blk-43961","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Authorization: Bearer <supabase-jwt>"},{"id":"blk-43962","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73444","text":"The gateway extracts "},{"id":"spn-73445","marks":["code"],"text":"auth.uid()"},{"id":"spn-73446","text":" and uses it to load the agent via RLS. If the agent does not belong to the caller, the query returns empty and the gateway returns "},{"id":"spn-73447","marks":["code"],"text":"NOT_FOUND"},{"id":"spn-73448","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-43963","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73449","text":"Post-MVP: per-agent API keys for public invocation."}]},{"id":"blk-43964","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73450","text":"Limit Checks"}]},{"id":"blk-43965","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73451","text":"Before routing to the provider, the gateway checks:"}]},{"id":"blk-43966","kind":"code","language":"sql","text":"SELECT total_requests, total_tokens, total_compute_ms\nFROM billing_usage\nWHERE user_id = auth.uid()\n  AND period_key = current_period();"},{"id":"blk-43967","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73452","text":"If any metric exceeds the user's tier limit, the gateway returns "},{"id":"spn-73453","marks":["code"],"text":"LIMIT_EXCEEDED"},{"id":"spn-73454","text":" without invoking the agent."}]},{"id":"blk-43968","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73455","text":"Session Handling"}]},{"id":"blk-43969","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43971","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73456","text":"If "},{"id":"spn-73457","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-73458","text":" is provided, it is forwarded to the provider as-is."}]}],"id":"blk-43970","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43973","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73459","text":"If absent, the provider may create a new session and return the "},{"id":"spn-73460","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-73461","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-43972","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43975","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73462","text":"The gateway treats "},{"id":"spn-73463","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-73464","text":" as "},{"id":"spn-73465","marks":["bold"],"text":"opaque"},{"id":"spn-73466","text":" -- never parses or validates it."}]}],"id":"blk-43974","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43977","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73467","text":"Session semantics are provider-specific (DO instance for Cloudflare, runtime"}]}],"id":"blk-43976","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-43978","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73468","text":"session for AgentCore)."}]},{"id":"blk-43979","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73469","text":"Streaming"}]},{"id":"blk-43980","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73470","text":"When the provider supports streaming, the gateway uses Server-Sent Events (SSE):"}]},{"id":"blk-43981","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Content-Type: text/event-stream\n\ndata: {\"type\":\"chunk\",\"text\":\"Hello\"}\ndata: {\"type\":\"chunk\",\"text\":\" world\"}\ndata: {\"type\":\"done\",\"usage\":{\"tokens\":12,\"computeMs\":340}}"},{"id":"blk-43982","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73471","text":"When a provider does not support true streaming, the gateway MAY emulate it by returning the full response as a single chunk followed by "},{"id":"spn-73472","marks":["code"],"text":"done"},{"id":"spn-73473","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-43983","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73474","text":"Error Normalization"}]},{"id":"blk-43984","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73475","text":"All errors are mapped to a standard code set:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-43986","spans":[{"id":"spn-73476","text":"Code"}]},{"id":"blk-43987","spans":[{"id":"spn-73477","text":"HTTP Status"}]},{"id":"blk-43988","spans":[{"id":"spn-73478","text":"Meaning"}]}],"id":"blk-43985","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-43989","spans":[{"id":"spn-73479","marks":["code"],"text":"UNAUTHENTICATED"}]},{"id":"blk-43990","spans":[{"id":"spn-73480","text":"401"}]},{"id":"blk-43991","spans":[{"id":"spn-73481","text":"Missing or invalid JWT"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43992","spans":[{"id":"spn-73482","marks":["code"],"text":"UNAUTHORIZED"}]},{"id":"blk-43993","spans":[{"id":"spn-73483","text":"403"}]},{"id":"blk-43994","spans":[{"id":"spn-73484","text":"Valid JWT but no access to this agent"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43995","spans":[{"id":"spn-73485","marks":["code"],"text":"NOT_FOUND"}]},{"id":"blk-43996","spans":[{"id":"spn-73486","text":"404"}]},{"id":"blk-43997","spans":[{"id":"spn-73487","text":"Agent does not exist (or not owned by caller)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43998","spans":[{"id":"spn-73488","marks":["code"],"text":"LIMIT_EXCEEDED"}]},{"id":"blk-43999","spans":[{"id":"spn-73489","text":"429"}]},{"id":"blk-44000","spans":[{"id":"spn-73490","text":"Plan limit reached for this period"}]}],[{"id":"blk-44001","spans":[{"id":"spn-73491","marks":["code"],"text":"DEPLOYMENT_FAILED"}]},{"id":"blk-44002","spans":[{"id":"spn-73492","text":"502"}]},{"id":"blk-44003","spans":[{"id":"spn-73493","text":"No active deployment or deployment is broken"}]}],[{"id":"blk-44004","spans":[{"id":"spn-73494","marks":["code"],"text":"RUNTIME_ERROR"}]},{"id":"blk-44005","spans":[{"id":"spn-73495","text":"502"}]},{"id":"blk-44006","spans":[{"id":"spn-73496","text":"Provider returned an error during execution"}]}],[{"id":"blk-44007","spans":[{"id":"spn-73497","marks":["code"],"text":"INVALID_REQUEST"}]},{"id":"blk-44008","spans":[{"id":"spn-73498","text":"400"}]},{"id":"blk-44009","spans":[{"id":"spn-73499","text":"Malformed input or missing required fields"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-44010","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"LIMIT_EXCEEDED\",\n    \"message\": \"Monthly request limit reached. Upgrade your plan.\",\n    \"traceId\": \"tr_abc123\"\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-44011","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73500","marks":["bold"],"text":"Rule:"},{"id":"spn-73501","text":" Error messages must be safe for display. Never include secrets or internal stack traces."}]},{"id":"blk-44012","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73502","text":"Rate Limiting"}]},{"id":"blk-44013","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73503","text":"The gateway SHOULD enforce per-user and per-agent rate limits beyond plan quotas:"}]},{"id":"blk-44014","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44016","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73504","text":"Per-user: max N requests/second across all agents"}]}],"id":"blk-44015","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44018","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73505","text":"Per-agent: max M requests/second per agent"}]}],"id":"blk-44017","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44020","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73506","text":"Payload size: max 1 MB request body"}]}],"id":"blk-44019","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44021","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73507","text":"Checklist"}]},{"id":"blk-44022","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44024","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73508","text":"[ ] Every invocation is authenticated via Supabase Auth JWT"}]}],"id":"blk-44023","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44026","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73509","text":"[ ] Agent status is verified as "},{"id":"spn-73510","marks":["code"],"text":"active"},{"id":"spn-73511","text":" before routing"}]}],"id":"blk-44025","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44028","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73512","text":"[ ] Plan limits are checked before invoking the provider"}]}],"id":"blk-44027","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44030","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73513","text":"[ ] "},{"id":"spn-73514","marks":["code"],"text":"traceId"},{"id":"spn-73515","text":" is generated or forwarded on every request"}]}],"id":"blk-44029","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44032","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73516","text":"[ ] Errors are normalized to the standard code set"}]}],"id":"blk-44031","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44034","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73517","text":"[ ] Error messages never contain secrets or internal details"}]}],"id":"blk-44033","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44036","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73518","text":"[ ] "},{"id":"spn-73519","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-73520","text":" is treated as opaque"}]}],"id":"blk-44035","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44038","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73521","text":"[ ] Streaming uses SSE format when supported"}]}],"id":"blk-44037","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44040","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73522","text":"[ ] Request payload size is validated"}]}],"id":"blk-44039","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieratrqui6t7jz24ly7i7rlvkwf3ggaj7hcl3up5clqa2mcyptb4ky2q","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}